<title>THAILAND: Thailand to protect finance firm depositors.</title>
<headline>Thailand to protect finance firm depositors.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Friday stepped in to protect depositors in the troubled finance company sector after suspending 16 ailing firms and ordering them to merge with healthy ones earlier in the day.</p>
<p>On Monday, yet another curb on finance companies deposit rates would be imposed to ease their cost burdens, central bank governor Rerngchai Marakanond told a news conference. No details were given.</p>
</text>
